(rectangle (start 210.82 35.56) (end 393.7 166.37) (stroke (width 0) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "c592319f-db01-5ef8-91ca-c8c307c45170"))
(text "-6 V: two LT3094 in parallel (ADR 0015 item 3)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 212.09 34.29 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "dad8cc16-5445-5c13-8463-b7deb6893747"))
(text_box "Notes\n1. Function: HPA_P6V0 from two LT3045 and HPA_N6V0 from two LT3094 in parallel, as both ADI\n   datasheets describe (LT3045 p. 21 Fig. 7, LT3094 p. 25 Fig. 15; ADR 0015 item 3).\n2. Absent state: HPA_LDO_EN pulled down: the four LDOs off; enabled >= 10 ms after HPA_RAIL_EN.\n3. SET tied per rail, RSET 2 x 60.4 kΩ (200 µA x 30.2 kΩ = 6.04 V), CSET 2 x 0.47 µF (≈ 65 ms);\n   RILIM 523 Ω (LT3045) / 13.0 kΩ (LT3094) per device: pair limits 516-631 / 519-646 mA.\n4. PGFB tied to IN (fast start-up off), PG open; OUT and OUTS joined at each device, then a\n   20 mΩ PCB trace ballast (net tie) to the shared rail. LT3094 exposed pad is IN (-7 V).\n5. Constraints: PCB-A-06, PCB-A-14. Unless noted: resistors 1 % 0603, capacitors X7R." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 275.59 226.06 0) (size 129.54 22.86) (margins 1.905 1.905 1.905 1.905) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "656d42f4-f356-55b1-aeb3-24b553d4135d"))
(text "Interface" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 22.86 256.54 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "dd26958e-49cd-501a-acda-b136bc8ec1f1"))
